@startuml "Workflow d'upload de fichiers"

title Workflow d'upload de fichiers

participant User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Next.js API)" as API
participant "Auth Service\n(JWT + Sessions)" as Auth
participant "File Storage\n(AWS S3)" as Storage
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

User -> Frontend: Upload file
Frontend -> API: POST /api/upload
API -> Auth: Verify permissions
Auth --> API: Upload authorized

API -> Storage: PUT /bucket/file
Storage --> API: File URL
API -> DB: Store file metadata
DB --> API: Record saved

API --> Frontend: Upload success
Frontend --> User: File uploaded

@enduml